G["That seems terribly inconvenient, if you ask me. I much prefer this chair."]="Parece terrivelmente inconveniente, isso, sim. Sou mais essa cadeira."
G["That sounds like the kind of inspiration we'd receive from Beledar."]="Parece o tipo de inspiração que recebemos de Beledar."
